      <p>Home decor products are delivered digitally upon successful payment. Due to the instant-access nature of digital delivery, the order is considered fulfilled at the point of download availability. Contact support within 48 hours if you experience access issues.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">4. Refund Policy</h2>
      <p>Due to the digital delivery nature of our home decor products, all sales are final once download access is provided. For technical issues preventing access contact ${store.contact_email || 'hello@' + store.domain}.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">5. Licence</h2>
      <p class="mb-2">Upon purchase you are granted a non-exclusive, non-transferable licence for personal and commercial use. You may:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-1">
        <li>Print and display in homes, offices and commercial properties</li>
        <li>Use in interior design, staging and client projects</li>
        <li>Modify colour profiles for different printing methods</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-2">You may not redistribute, resell, sublicense or share the original digital files.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
